    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "id": 104,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Efficiency scorecard — is my usage healthy?",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "cacheRead / cacheCreation — how many times you reused what you paid to cache. THE headline efficiency number. Caching breaks even at ~1.3x, so anything above that is already winning. Under 1x you are paying to build context you never reuse — almost always too many short sessions. Target >5x; interactive sessions typically reach 10-12x, one-shot `claude -p` runs only 3-5x. Raise it with `claude --continue` instead of starting fresh.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "decimals": 1,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 5 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 10 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "id": 17,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time(claude_code_token_usage{type=\"cacheRead\", project=~\"$project\", model=~\"$model\", query_source=~\"$query_source\"}[$__range])) / sum(max_over_time(claude_code_token_usage{type=\"cacheCreation\", project=~\"$project\", model=~\"$model\", query_source=~\"$query_source\"}[$__range]))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "A",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Cache amortization",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Share of spend going to WRITING the cache. Cache writes cost 1.25x input, reads 0.1x — a 12.5x spread — so writes dominate the bill even at a small share of tokens. Do NOT try to drive this to zero: writes are the cost of admission, and no writes means no cheap reads. Under ~30% is healthy; over 50% means sessions are dying before they amortize.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "decimals": 1,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 30 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 50 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 6 },
      "id": 13,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time(claude_code_token_cost_usd{type=\"cacheCreation\", project=~\"$project\", model=~\"$model\", query_source=~\"$query_source\"}[$__range])) / sum(max_over_time(claude_code_token_cost_usd{project=~\"$project\", model=~\"$model\", query_source=~\"$query_source\"}[$__range])) * 100",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "A",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Cache write % of cost",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "output / cacheRead. Output is the most expensive lane at 5x input (50x a cache read), and extended thinking is billed as output too. Under 1% = reading/analysis work. 1-3% = normal coding. Over 5% = generation-heavy: lots of code/prose written, or high effort thinking. Lower it by reducing effort, making targeted edits instead of whole-file rewrites, and not asking for summaries you won't read.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "decimals": 2,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 3 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 6 },
      "id": 18,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time(claude_code_token_usage{type=\"output\", project=~\"$project\", model=~\"$model\", query_source=~\"$query_source\"}[$__range])) / sum(max_over_time(claude_code_token_usage{type=\"cacheRead\", project=~\"$project\", model=~\"$model\", query_source=~\"$query_source\"}[$__range])) * 100",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "A",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Generation intensity",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "input / all tokens. Fresh tokens the cache did NOT cover. Should be a rounding error — under 1% means caching is doing its job. Above ~5% something is defeating the prefix cache (context rebuilt in a different shape each turn, or constant model switching).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "decimals": 2,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 4, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "id": 19,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time(claude_code_token_usage{type=\"input\", project=~\"$project\", model=~\"$model\", query_source=~\"$query_source\"}[$__range])) / sum(max_over_time(claude_code_token_usage{project=~\"$project\", model=~\"$model\", query_source=~\"$query_source\"}[$__range])) * 100",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "A",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Uncached input",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Total cost / distinct sessions. Read it TOGETHER with the session count next to it: if sessions fell and this rose, that's good — you consolidated work into fewer, longer sessions. It's only a bad signal when total cost rises with it.",
